# into the list. A later generic call on it infers `T` from it: the argument
# probe keeps the share site its use finds, so the next pass copies instead of
# moving and the call is not E0904. Covers a `#Numeric` distinct Float with a
# bounded and a prelude generic, a plain Float and a struct, on every
# optimization level.
